  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "共学 D3：Solana 第一笔真实 swap 全流程",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "Jupiter API 旧端点已下线，新 API 只路由 mainnet。今天完成了第一笔真实链上 swap：0.01 SOL 走 4 ",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',serif}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;background:#1c1c1e;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:80px 90px 70px}\n.cover::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9a96e,#e8d5b7,#c9a96e)}\n.cover::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:3px;left:40px;right:40px;height:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.3)}\n.book-icon{position:absolute;top:50px;right:80px;width:120px;height:160px;border:2px solid rgba(201,169,110,0.3);border-radius:2px 8px 8px 2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.08),rgba(201,169,110,0.02))}\n.book-icon::after{content:'';position:absolute;left:8px;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:rgba(201,169,110,0.15)}\n.book-spine{position:absolute;top:40px;right:195px;width:6px;height:170px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(201,169,110,0.2),rgba(201,169,110,0.05));border-radius:1px}\n.tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#c9a96e;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.title{font-size:40px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.25;color:#f5f0e8;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:1px;max-width:620px}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a09580;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:30px;max-width:540px;font-style:italic}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding-top:24px}\n.author{font-size:14px;color:#8a8070;letter-spacing:1px}\n.dot{color:#c9a96e;margin:0 6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body><div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"book-icon\"></div><div class=\"book-spine\"></div><div class=\"tag\">READING NOTES</div><h1 class=\"title\">共学 D3：Solana 第一笔真实 swap 全流程（Jupiter API + mainnet）</h1><p class=\"subtitle\">Jupiter API 旧端点已下线，新 API 只路由 mainnet。今天完成了第一笔真实链上 swap：0.01 SOL 走 4 池多跳路由，Gas 仅 0.0000086 SOL，并踩到一个「客户端自报成功 ≠ 链上可查」的坑。</p><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div></div></body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D3：Solana 第一笔真实 swap 全流程</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 3 天\n2026-08-07</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">计划里 D3 是\"第一笔 devnet swap\"，最后变成了 mainnet 真实小额 swap——中间踩了三个坑，每个都值得记下来。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑一：Jupiter 旧 API 已下线/被墙</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">按计划先探测 Jupiter API 连通性。<code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">quote-api.jup.ag</code> 的 v6/v7 端点<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">超时无响应</strong>——DNS 正常，但连接不通（中国网络被墙）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">现行 API 是：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">https://api.jup.ag/swap/v1/quote   （Metis 路由引擎报价）\nhttps://api.jup.ag/swap/v2/build   （Router 路径，返回 raw instructions）</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">而且从中国网络直连依然超时，<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">必须走本机 Clash 代理 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">127.0.0.1:7890</code></strong> 才能访问。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑二：Jupiter 只路由 mainnet，devnet 无池</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">quote 成功后想发 devnet swap——结果发现 <strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">Jupiter Swap API 只索引 MAINNET 流动性</strong>。devnet 上 program 和 USDC mint 都在，但 Metis 路由引擎不索引 devnet 的池子，无池可路由。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论：devnet 上没有现成池子，想练 devnet 得自己用 Raydium SDK 建测试池（工程量不小，留给后续）。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">决定：改走 mainnet 极小金额真实 swap</strong>——0.01 SOL（约 0.73 美元），风险可忽略。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">执行记录：quote → build → 签名 → 广播</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">quote</strong>：0.01 SOL → 0.73 USDC（minOut 0.72，slippage 1%）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">build</strong>：拿到 computeBudget + 4 条 setup + swapInstruction（JUP6Lk...）+ 4 张 lookup table</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">组装</strong>：<code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">@solana/web3.js</code> 组装 v0 transaction，本地 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">id.json</code> 签名（私钥不出本机）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">广播</strong>：发送到 mainnet Helius RPC → confirmed</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">链上验证（二值判据）</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">tx</strong>: <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">Solscan</strong>: <a href=\"https://solscan.io/tx/27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5\" style=\"color:#2c2c2c;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;word-break:break-all;\">https://solscan.io/tx/27QRepQ1pewa8Y2YUfWEZJ5EGGiaaRRWgLko3Y4AxLFpvpiwj9PCVWQhkAZq6zze8giqxEtNck1QRNa7fQQ6Jid5</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">路由</strong>：PancakeSwap → Meteora DLMM → AlphaQ → Deriverse（4 池多跳）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">Gas</strong>：0.0000086 SOL（约 0.0006 美元）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">钱包核对</strong>：SOL 0.201154956 → 0.191146329（扣 0.01 + fee 吻合）；USDC 29.5 → 30.226164（+0.726 与 quote 0.73 一致）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">坑三：客户端自报成功 ≠ 链上可查</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">广播后客户端立刻返回 SUCCESS，但<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">马上查 <code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">getTransaction</code> 是 NOT FOUND</strong>——索引延迟约 3 秒，等几秒再查才成功。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这个教训很重要：<strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">「客户端自报」不能当「链上可查」的证据</strong>。验证必须用二值判据（tx hash 在 Solscan/链上存在才算数），这也是这几天共学一直在强调的方法论。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">产出</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/jupiter_swap_d3.py</code> — quote + build 流程（Python）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">scripts/swap_mainnet.mjs</code> — 完整签名+广播（Node）</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\"><code style=\"background:#f5f5f5;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;\">solana-arbitrage</code> skill 更新：jupiter-swap-api-2026.md 端点表 + 实测结果</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天（D4）</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">价格监控脚本 v0：Helius RPC / Jupiter Quote API 拉 DEX 报价，Python 打印价差</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;\"></span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">读 toll-fee-pool / premium-buyin-lp 群讨论 case</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><em>本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
